WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.320
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.320
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.260
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.260
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.830
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.770
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.790
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.790
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.230
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.230
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.000
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.000
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.280
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.280
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.720
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.720
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.310
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.310
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.770
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.770
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.840
I can say love

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.570
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.570
It overflows with love.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.570
will you love me?

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.180
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.180
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.130
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.130
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.690
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.690
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:08.340
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:08.340
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.360
A training voyage?

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:26.030
That's right.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:30.270
After all, Seina-chan's at the second stage of body enhancement now, right?

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:34.510
And starting today, I can finally participate in training!

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.840
But if Seina-kun goes into space...

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:40.050
Don't worry about it.

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:42.920
It's not really outer space; it's only a region just outside the border.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.580
It's a bunch of empty space so pirates would never bother going there.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.590
Plus I'll be on board as the supervising instructor,

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:53.060
and my pirate encounter rate is at 0 percent.

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:55.060
Your encounter rate is zero?!

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.930
It's going to be pretty boring training.

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:58.260
Right, Kiriko?

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.730
It's not a walk in the park.

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:05.270
I'll admit that mine wasn't anything very special, though.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:08.370
I'm happy just being able to go into space!

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:13.550
Had I stayed on Earth I don't think I would've been able to go into space!

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:17.650
Happy just being able to go into space...

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:21.050
I had almost forgotten that feeling...

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:23.960
But since I do have the chance to go into space now,

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:27.790
I hope I can make all kinds of interesting memories!

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:28.660
Eh?

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:29.900
Interesting...?

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:31.260
Memories...?

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:37.260
"A Stormy Space Training Voyage"

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:47.940
I, Seiryo Tennan, have been ordered to be captain for your training voyage!

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:50.210
Understood!

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:55.710
I will be his First Officer. My name is Amane Kaunaq.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:00.820
Amane-san...!

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:04.860
Please treat us well!

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:07.200
To think that we would be partnered with the Zero Goddess!

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.670
I'm so unbelievably happy and excited I don't know what to do!

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:12.300
R-right...

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.840
Yes?

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:17.270
I don't mean to boast, but I'm also the highest ranked

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:20.310
when it comes to low pirate encounter rates.

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:21.550
We know!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.380
Which is why we prepared you a special captain's seat!

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:27.580
"Captain's Seat" Which is why we prepared you a special captain's seat!

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:32.860
It is indeed a manly seat worthy of a captain!

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:33.920
I like it!

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:36.360
Alright! Prepare for departure!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:40.600
Have all students line up on Deck 3!

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:41.530
Moron.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:53.740
It's Kiriko-san and the others!

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:10.220
The spaceport has given us clearance for departure!

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.420
OK! Let's go!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.050
Elma-san.

00:04:37.050 --> 00:04:42.060
We leave each other for a short while, but I promise I will return to you!

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:46.260
He's taking it too seriously. It's just simple training.

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.900
Our first training! Let's do it!

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:55.240
Your hard-working attitude isn't going to last very long...

00:04:56.570 --> 00:05:03.710
All students are to proceed to their assigned training posts.

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:05.280
Hey, let's get going you guys!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.320
Yeah, alright, we heard.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:08.750
You sure are enthusiastic, aren't you?

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:13.090
Well, I'll be going my own route now...

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:14.790
Where are you going, NB?

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:17.350
I'm busy. Later!

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:21.230
Busy...?

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:38.250
This is training?

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.580
Who cares, at least it's easy.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:40.850
Eventually they'll let us do other stuff.

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:45.120
But this feels more like a part-time job than training...

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:53.260
Captain. We will be arriving at our hyperspace jump point momentarily.

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:57.200
Did you get a look at the list of students onboard?

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.070
Yeah.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.740
Seina Yamada, right?

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:01.570
It should be OK, though.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:05.940
This time we have the Zero Goddess onboard,

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:07.740
and what's-his-face too...

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.510
We'll be fine!

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:15.290
Here are the packages going to the Cyan planetary system!

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:17.860
He's really serious about this, isn't he?

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:20.660
That's Seina for you!

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:23.230
Attention, all students.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:27.660
Morning work is now over.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.670
Hyperspace jump program ready!

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:34.570
OK! Load hyperspace jump program!

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:38.280
Even as a teacher it's still as boring as hell...

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.680
Energy output at 120.

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:46.750
Program complete.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:50.520
Hyperspace jump in 10...

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:51.420
8...

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.420
7...

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:53.320
6...

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:56.260
5...

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.260
What's happened?!

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:58.630
Internal engine pressure decreasing!

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:01.600
Energy output is diminished!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.930
W-what the...?!

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:04.270
What's wrong?!

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.140
Energy generator output has reduced!

00:07:07.140 --> 00:07:08.610
Main power is offline!

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.840
Backup power system is on!

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.940
We can't maintain the hyperspace drive!

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:14.170
Exiting jump!

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:21.650
Students! This is your captain, Seiryo Tennan!

00:07:21.650 --> 00:07:26.320
Due to engine trouble, we are performing emergency repairs in normal space.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:29.460
You will all go to your rooms and wait for further instructions.

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:30.090
That is all!

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.690
Engine trouble?

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:37.070
Do you think we'll be OK?

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:40.600
It's not like he's telling us to evacuate, so it can't be that bad.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:44.580
Who knows, this might actually be another part of the training curriculum!

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.240
It wouldn't surprise me.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:50.200
I bet they'll have a mock pirate raid next or something.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:54.020
So exhausted...

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:57.290
NB! You're gonna get in trouble for wandering around on your own!

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:00.760
Time to check and see what kind of video I got.

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.250
H-hey...!

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:08.530
I take pride in my work.

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:10.270
Where in the world did you get this...?!

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:14.770
I think this is inside a dressing room or a locker room!

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:18.000
Wait! Don't tell me that's a minor!

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:25.180
What now?! Report!

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:29.050
Unidentified vessel ahead of us!

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:30.490
Pirates!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:33.890
Aw, man. My record...

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:36.230
Ask nearby GP ships for reinforcements!

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:38.900
Even though we had the Zero Goddess on board,

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:41.130
and what's-his-face too...

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:43.730
Seina's bad luck was just too strong...

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:46.940
But it could be Ryoko-sama's ship!

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:48.570
We've got some data on the enemy ship!

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:50.610
It's a raid ship belonging to the Da Ruma!

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:52.040
Dang...

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.540
Because of our engine trouble we can't fire our particle cannons...!

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:56.280
All cannons, prepare to fire!

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:56.910
Uh...

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:59.580
Fire particle cannons!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:02.150
Due to our engine trouble we cannot fire particle cannons!

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:04.150
Sending transmission requesting reinforcements!

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:07.060
Fire! Vaporize those filthy pirates!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:09.390
Due to our engine trouble we cannot fire particle cannons!

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.260
Raising forward shields to maximum power!

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:13.090
Fire the particle cannons!

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:16.700
Laser beams coming from the enemy ship!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:20.500
W-what in the world's going on?!

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:22.340
What a great camera angle! You can see everything!

00:09:22.340 --> 00:09:23.810
What?!

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:27.910
The enemy vessel has released several small raid ships toward us!

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:29.550
Fire the particle cannons!

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:32.140
Fire! Fire!

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.680
I can't see a thing with this steam...!

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.760
What a bunch of little kids...

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.320
Outta the way!

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:02.580
Intruders have boarded from the small raid ships!

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.250
They're spreading out and heading for the bridge!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:09.010
Heh. To think that they would dare challenge me.

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:10.920
The fools.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:11.390
Fire the...!

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:14.050
You wimp! Go take care of them already!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.060
OK, OK, OK!

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:20.530
Get up! Get up!

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.520
Gulp!

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:26.300
Attention, students!

00:10:26.300 --> 00:10:29.340
We are locked in combat with an enemy pirate vessel.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:31.810
You will all remain in your rooms.

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.880
You are absolutely not to go outside.

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:35.150
That is all!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.250
Don't be broadcasting your face...

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.020
Everyone prepare for an assault!

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:40.570
Follow me!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:47.120
The enemy has broken through blocks 32 and 36!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.690
Seal off blocks 40 through 48!

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:51.800
Several smaller enemy ships approaching!

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.930
We can't maintain shield integrity!

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:55.370
Locked in combat?

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:59.170
It's no good. The communication line is completely cut.

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:00.570
Where're you going?

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:03.040
Outside to look for a line that does work.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.710
You wanna come too?

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:06.110
But the pirates...!

00:11:06.110 --> 00:11:08.250
Don't you wanna see the rest...?

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:10.280
Seina! This is just training!

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:13.050
The pirate raid is just another part of the training!

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:18.690
That's right! It's an event that the academy prepared in advance!

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:19.990
Um, well...

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:36.770
What're you doing? I'm not seeing anyone!

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:38.980
Quit yer whinin' and look.

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:40.440
Oh, there's someone there!

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.840
Lemme see...

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:44.950
Who do you think it is?

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:47.550
I can't tell. It's hard to see...

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:50.110
Now I've got you, you filthy pirates!

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:58.950
Stop, pirate!

00:12:00.430 --> 00:12:04.430
...Wasn't that... ...... Seiryo-sensei just now...?

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:05.460
Yes...

00:12:08.610 --> 00:12:10.400
What's he doing?

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:15.910
That moron! At a time like this...!

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:19.750
You guys have the bridge!

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:20.580
Prepare to die...!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.020
Tennan-sensei! It's me! Seina Yamada!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:26.060
All of my students have been ordered to stay in their rooms!

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.590
None of them would be in a place like this!

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.860
B-but...!

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:32.730
Prepare to...!

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:35.600
The enemy is close!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:40.230
They're trying to conceal themselves, but they can't fool me!

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:43.270
Hey, Seina!

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:44.270
Where are you?!

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:45.870
Seina-kun!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.730
Sorry...!

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:58.820
Sensei!

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.790
Hurry to a safe place!

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:03.290
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:04.230
Seina...

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:20.010
Sensei!

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:21.140
Are you all right?!

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:22.580
Quiet!

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:24.050
Come out, you pirates!

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:27.040
I'll put an end to you right here!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.200
Line 066 has been encroached!

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.530
Barriers 33 through 41 are opening!

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.640
Line 022 recovered!

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:50.170
Barriers 12 through 17 are closed.

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:52.080
It's no good! At this rate...!

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:54.200
A reinforcement GP ship has arrived!

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:58.110
My name is Kyo Komachi.

00:13:58.110 --> 00:13:59.580
And yours is...?

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:02.320
As if I would ever introduce myself to a dirty pirate!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.460
How rude.

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.290
A pirate who cares about manners?

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:10.280
What a joke!

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:22.910
W-what the...?!

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.570
They're reacting to the lasers!

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:27.380
A mechanical malfunction?!

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.350
I can't break free!

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.590
You'll never become a superior GP officer like that!

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:37.250
Stop playing around!

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:42.630
Damn it! With things as they are, Seina's...

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:44.430
Sounds like the mother ship's fightin' right now!

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:49.870
Perfect! We can use this chance to steal us some expensive stuff!

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:51.160
Running away...?!

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:59.640
This gel is nothing...

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:00.940
Stop it!

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:02.710
They react to the lasers, you moron!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.980
What?!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.280
They're broken...

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.410
What are?

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:12.960
Oh no, the floor!

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:15.160
Quiet!

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:18.330
Hey. The sealant gel system is malfunctioning.

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:20.730
Can't you control it from there?

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:25.400
No luck. The controls there seem to have been overridden or something...

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.930
Overridden...?

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:29.510
Pirate ship accessed!

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:34.640
For a bunch of pirates they sure are hot...!

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:37.550
Where's Seina?

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:40.280
Not sure, we got separated...

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:41.620
Look for him!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:43.720
Where could you be, Seina-san...?

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:46.260
I hope you're alright...

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:47.190
What?!

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:49.430
Komachi-sama's trapped in the cargo room?!

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:50.630
We gotta go help her!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.890
Got it!

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.870
If somebody doesn't come soon...

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:58.740
We're going to wind up dead here...

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:02.170
Don't talk so at ease!

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:03.370
Are you listening?!

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:05.640
Isn't that a student?

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:08.310
Yeah. He's currently taking special supplementary courses.

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:12.750
Observing my gallantry is the best training there is for him.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:14.220
Are you stupid?!

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:18.090
Dragging a student into a battle?!

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:20.760
What should I do?!

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:22.560
Oh! That's it!

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:23.820
This should do it...

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:28.600
Hurry and stop the gel, NB!

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:31.370
Hold your horses!

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:34.170
No good. I can't control it from here.

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:35.370
What?!

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:36.910
But don't worry!

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:40.340
Let's leave this one up to Seina-san!

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:41.310
You fool!

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:43.580
You're a pirate, who are you to act all high and mighty?!

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:45.950
This has nothing to do with pirates or the GP or anything else!

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:48.750
Protecting weaker people is the principle of space!

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:52.760
Don't you even know the pride of people who fight in space?!

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:54.990
T-that hurts...

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.160
And you call yourself a man?!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.760
Hey! You listenin'?!

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.750
Hey!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.070
How did that boy...

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:06.000
I see... That could do it...

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.000
That primitive tool...

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.010
I have to stop it right away...

00:17:11.010 --> 00:17:12.410
Seina-san, Seina-san!

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:13.610
NB...?

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:17.950
There's a panel next to where you're standing, right?

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:19.580
Yeah, there is.

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:22.020
Could you open it and do what I tell you?

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.050
Got it!

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:25.960
I switch this one with Number 3...

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:26.920
That's it.

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:28.360
Then switch that with that...

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:31.360
I see, so he's reprogramming the circuits directly...

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:34.700
That would be the best course of action in this situation.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:38.500
OK! Now I can control them from here!

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:40.770
We did it!

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:44.170
That boy's not bad at all!

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:46.140
Unlike this guy!

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:55.290
Komachi-sama! Are you all right?!

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.390
Yeah, it's nothing much.

00:17:57.390 --> 00:17:59.590
Hey! Did you bring a chainsaw?!

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:01.490
W-what are you planning to do?!

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:04.260
We brought it, but why do you need such a primitive item?

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:05.160
Stop!

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:08.300
Both of our lower bodies are entangled in complicated positions!

00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:10.400
Shut up!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.740
Please don't see me...

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:15.870
The pirates are there! Look out!

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:16.970
Stupid!

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:19.980
So that's how you go and thank me?

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.910
...The enemy! Fire! ...Later!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:22.970
You idiots!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.650
Don't use swords or guns!

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:27.250
But...!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.690
That's a student!

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.490
Let's retreat immediately.

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:32.320
What do we do with him?

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:35.120
There's no time. Take him too!

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:38.360
W-what?!

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:39.960
Hey! Wait!

00:18:39.960 --> 00:18:42.860
Hey, boy! What's your name?

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.670
Seina Yamada!

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.670
Seina?!

00:18:47.670 --> 00:18:49.670
So you're the one everyone's talking about...

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:52.610
Watch out for a pirate by the name of Tarant.

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:56.610
I'm telling you this in return for saving my life.

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:57.850
Seina Yamada!

00:18:57.850 --> 00:19:00.850
If you try any funny business with Amane while cheering her up

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:04.150
when she's still stricken with grief over me, you can bet you'll regret it!

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:05.190
Do I make myself clear?!

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:09.930
There is a huge wall of class difference that separates the two of you!

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:11.260
I am...

00:19:12.560 --> 00:19:15.260
...Seiryo Tennan!

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:21.200
Seina! Are you hurt?

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:23.110
A-Amane-san!

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:26.200
They took Seiryo-sensei...

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:32.780
Oh, uh... I see.

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:35.590
What a terrible loss...

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:37.650
We have to hurry and save him!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:39.220
We can't in our present combat state!

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:40.360
But...!

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:43.230
The students take top priority!

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:46.030
Seiryo-sensei would certainly say the same thing...

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:47.790
You're smiling.

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.000
I see...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.140
In that sector of space...

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:59.010
They encountered pirates in only 3 hours and 36 minutes time.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:01.180
The odds of that happening are infinitesimal!

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:06.250
That's on the same level as your Mitoto-san and Mihoshi-san, isn't it?

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:09.490
It's an unbelievable gift, indeed.

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:13.920
I suppose his assistance really is needed in that unit.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:19.730
Even so, assigning an inexperienced GP cadet to a position is a little too...

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:22.300
Let's try using the Kamidake.

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:25.200
The Kamidake?! Are you sure?

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:28.870
I was just thinking it was about time we ran a simulated test,

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:33.570
and if he's on board, it'll certainly become a true field test.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:39.550
It must have been rough!

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:42.520
I underestimated Seina's bad luck.

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:45.050
Being able to attract pirates like that...

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.590
...it's almost like the legend of Lorelei, isn't it?

00:20:47.590 --> 00:20:49.160
Is that an Earth legend?

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:51.460
In it, sirens on an island would enchant and lure pirates with their singing,

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:53.500
causing their ships to strike the reefs and drown.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:55.900
It's that sort of story about evil spirits...

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.570
I heard about that once from Mihoshi!

00:20:57.570 --> 00:21:00.040
The one where a ghost asks for water in a ladle then sinks your ship too?

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:02.510
That's the Ship Ghost story.

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:03.910
Same difference.

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:06.540
By the way, how is the GP's ship ghost feeling anyway?

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:09.310
Seina-chan isn't an evil spirit!

00:21:14.180 --> 00:21:16.720
I'm so glad Seina-kun was OK!

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:20.290
It's too bad about Seiryo-sensei, but...

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.830
Such a sad turn of events...

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:27.030
Amane. I saw that smile.

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:28.970
I wasn't smiling...

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:31.970
The training certainly turned into a nightmare, didn't it?

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:35.500
Nah, he really enjoyed all the erotic action!

00:21:35.970 --> 00:21:39.080
An authentic account of the stormy space training voyage!

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:41.480
Let's have a look!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:54.090
Damn, what's he doing in the middle of training?!

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:57.630
Amane! What in the world did you teach him?!

00:21:57.630 --> 00:21:59.630
I had nothing to do with it! That was all Seina...

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:03.190
If Seina-chan winds up as a perverted boy, it'll be all your fault!

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:07.060
Ow...

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.740
uchuu de saitei saiaku

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.740
You're the worst, most hopeless,

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:26.860
un warui Unlucky Boy

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:26.860
most unlucky boy in space.

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:34.070
anna koto shite te mo

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:34.070
No matter what you do,

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:36.800
konna koto shite te mo

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:36.800
no matter what you do,

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:41.590
otozureru jiko tensai sugoi wana

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:41.590
you can't escape the accidents, disasters and traps

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:43.880
anata wa nigerarenai

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:43.880
that come your way.

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:47.450
keikai shite te mo

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:47.450
Even if your really careful...

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.160
ikinari shichatte mo

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.160
And even if you're not...

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:56.390
saitei saiaku dame dame no

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:56.390
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:22:56.390 --> 00:23:00.860
anata wa doshiyou mo nai

00:22:56.390 --> 00:23:00.860
You're a lost cause.

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:10.810
anata ga saitei saiaku

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:10.810
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:15.430
anata wa Unlucky Boy

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:15.430
You're an unlucky boy.

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:20.510
dakedo anata shika mienai

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:20.510
But all I can see is you,

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:26.030
sonna anata shika mienai

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:26.030
just the way you are.

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:36.300
On-the-job training is a big part of the GP Academy's curriculum!

00:23:36.300 --> 00:23:38.740
No matter where I'm assigned to, I have to do my best!

00:23:38.740 --> 00:23:40.970
Which is what I would think if I knew where I was!

00:23:40.970 --> 00:23:42.770
What's with that pirate ship?!

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:45.170
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP! Baptism
